# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Hidden evaluation data (anti-contamination).
#
# The PUBLIC validation split ships in-repo so anyone can develop and reproduce
# the demo board. The HIDDEN TEST split -- gold answers + the secret generator
# parameters -- must never be committed: a benchmark whose answers are public
# measures memorisation, not capability.
#
# Pull it (requires access to the gated HF dataset):
#   pixi run -e full python scripts/pull_eval_data.py
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/private/
*.private.yaml
.hf_token
paper/build/

